Date:   Sat Oct 10 18:06:25 2026 -0700

    Documents: four statements that described history
    
    architecture.md: which Run a woken record started is read from the Tape,
    not from a table in memory that no longer exists; writing "fired" first
    counts an occurrence once and does not by itself promise it never starts
    twice; an execution nobody started also leaves a notice on the mode line.
    CONTEXT.md: an in-place command joins its Workspace's main conversation.
    
    Named by the architecture review of 2026-10-10.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

